  "Add 1 to hit rolls for this unit's shooting attacks that target an enemy unit with 5 or more models that is more than 12\" from this unit.": "",
  "Add the 'Trample and Gore' ability to your hero's warscroll. You cannot pick this upgrade if your hero has another **^^Rampage^^** ability.": "",
  "For each **daemonic power point** this unit has:\r\n• Add 1\" to its Move characteristic\r\n• Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of its weapons.": "",
  "Add 2 to the control scores of friendly non-**^^Hero Helsmiths of Hashut^^** units while they are contesting the same objective as this unit.": "",
  "Add the 'Immolating Presence' ability to your hero's warscroll. You cannot pick this upgrade if your hero has another **^^Rampage^^** ability.": "",
  "This unit can chant prayers from the 'Prayers of the Scorched Sect' lore as if it had **^^Priest (1)^^** and it knows all the prayers from that lore.": "",
  "Your hero gains the **^^Priest (1)^^** keyword, the 'Extract Power' ability and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Helsmiths of Hashut^^** units": "",
  "Roll a dice for each model in this unit. Add the number of **daemonic power points** this unit has. For each 6+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.": "",
  "If this unit used a **^^Shoot^^** ability this turn and all of its attacks targeted the same enemy **^^Infantry^^** unit, that enemy unit is the target.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, the Damage characteristic of this unit's **Hashu-Zharr Rockets** is 5 if the target is a **^^Monster^^** or **^^War Machine^^**.": "",
  "If this unit is contesting an objective you control, pick a friendly non-**^^Hobgrot Helsmiths of Hashut^^** unit wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 2+, for the rest of the turn, if the unmodified hit roll for an attack that targets this unit is 1-4, the attack fails and the attack sequence ends.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, for the rest of the turn, add 1 to chanting rolls for friendly **^^Helsmiths of Hashut Priests^^** while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "For the purposes of the 'Daemonic Resilience' ability, this unit always counts as having 1 more **daemonic power point** than the number it actually has, to a maximum of 3.": "",
  "This unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^**. In addition, each time you make an unmodified ward roll of 6 for this unit, after all damage points have been allocated, **Heal (1)** this unit.": "",
  "Pick another visible friendly non-**^^Hobgrot Helsmiths of Hashut Infantry^^** unit, **Deathshrieker Rocket Battery** or **Tormentor Bombard** within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "During your Path to Glory campaign, keep a tally of the number of **desolation tokens** you give. Each time the tally reaches a multiple of 15, this unit gains the next rank on its Path.": "",
  "Pick a friendly **^^Helsmiths of Hashut War Machine^^** wholly within 6\" of this unit to be the target. Add 6\" to the range of this ability for each **daemonic power point** this unit has.": "",
  "Roll a dice and add the number of enemy models in the target unit slain by attacks made by this unit this turn. If the result is 6+, the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "If this unit is contesting an objective, a **Place of Power** or a terrain feature and that objective, **Place of Power** or terrain feature has a friendly desolation token, give this unit 1 ritual point.": "",
  "Pick a visible enemy unit within 12\" of this unit to be the enemy target. Then, you can pick a friendly **^^Helsmiths of Hashut Infantry^^** unit in combat with the enemy target to be the friendly target.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+:\r\n• Inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.\r\n• If the roll exceeds the target's Health characteristic, it has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "If this unit is contesting an objective, a **Place of Power**, or a terrain feature and that objective, **Place of Power** or terrain feature has a friendly desolation token, give this unit 1 ritual point.": "",
  "Your hero's **Hashutite Blade** has **Anti-X (+1 Rend)**, where **X** is one of the following keywords: **^^Infantry^^**, **^^Cavalry^^**, **^^Monster^^**, **^^War Machine^^**, **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**": "",
  "Change your hero's Save characteristic to 3+. Their **Hashutite Blade** has an Attacks characteristic of 5 and **Crit (Mortal)**. They gain the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Helsmiths of Hashut^^** units": "",
  "• Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's melee weapons while it is contesting an objective you do not control.\r\n• Add 10 to this unit's control score while it is contesting an objective you control.": "",
  "Add 3 to the control scores of friendly **^^Helsmith of Hashut Infantry^^** units while they are wholly within 6\" of this unit. Add 6\" to the range of this ability for each **daemonic power point** this unit has.": "",
  "Your hero gains the **^^Wizard (1)^^** keyword. Their **Hashutite Blade** has an Attacks characteristic of 5 and **Crit (Mortal)**. They gain the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Helsmiths of Hashut^^** units": "",
  "Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target. Then, roll 2D6. This unit can move a distance up to the value of the roll. during that move, this unit can pass through models in the target unit but must end that move in combat.": "",
  "This unit's **Gong Carriers** are tokens. There is 1 **Gong Carrier** for every **^^Musician^^** in this unit. If this unit uses the 'Rally' command, as a reaction, you can remove a **Gong Carrier** to make an additional rally roll of D6.": "",
  "Ignore the first damage point allocated to each friendly non-**^^Hobgrot Helsmiths of Hashut^^** unit each phase while it is wholly within 6\" of this unit. Add 6\" to the range of this ability for each **daemonic power point** this unit has": "",
  "Remove up to 3 **daemonic power points** in total from any combination of friendly units wholly within 18\" of this unit. Then, allocate them to a different friendly non-**^^Hobgrot Helsmiths of Hashut^^** unit wholly within 18\" of this unit.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, give the target 1 **daemonic power point**.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *You cannot make more than one roll for each objective in each turn regardless of how many friendly units with this ability are contesting that objective.*": "",
  "Roll a number of dice equal to the number of **daemonic power points** this unit has for each other enemy unit within the combat range of the target of this unit's shooting attacks. For each 3+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the enemy unit being rolled for.": "",
  "While a friendly **^^Helsmiths of Hashut Cavalry^^** unit is wholly within 12\" of this unit:\r\n• That unit can use a **^^Retreat^^** ability and still use **^^Charge^^** abilities later in the turn.\r\n• No mortal damage is inflicted on that unit by **^^Retreat^^** abilities.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, add 2 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Immolation Cannons** for each unit picked to be the target of this ability, but each time this unit uses a **^^Shoot^^** ability, it must target each of those units with at least 3 of its attacks.": "",
  "If this unit used a **^^Shoot^^** ability this turn and all of its attacks targeted the same enemy unit, that enemy unit is the target. Then, you can pick a number of enemy units within 6\" of the target equal to the number of **daemonic power points** this unit has to be additional targets.": "",
  "Subtract 2 from run rolls and charge rolls for this unit.\r\nIn addition, at the end of each battle, roll a dice. On a 1, give this unit 1 **stone-flesh point** and note this on your Path to Glory roster. When this unit has 3 **stone-flesh points**, you must remove this unit from your Path to Glory roster.": "",
  "Pick a point on the battlefield within 9\" of this unit, then pick a second point on the battlefield within 9\" of the first point. Draw a line between the caster and the first point, and between the first and second points. Each enemy unit the lines pass across is a target. Then, make a casting roll of 2D6.": "",
  "Apply the effect(s) below that corresponds with the number of **daemonic power points** this unit has. These effects are cumulative.\r\n**1+** Add 1\" to this unit's Move characteristic.\r\n**2+** Add 1 to wound rolls for this unit's combat attacks.\r\n**3+** Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of this unit's melee weapons.": "",
  "If this unit is in combat with any enemy **^^Heroes^^**, it can use 2 **^^Fight^^** abilities this phase. After the first is used, however, this unit has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the phase and can only be picked to use a second **^^Fight^^** ability if it is still in combat with any enemy **^^Heroes^^**.": "",
  "This unit's **Gong Carriers** are tokens. There is 1 **Gong Carrier** for every **^^Musician^^** in this unit. If this unit uses the 'Rally' command, make 2 additional rally rolls of D6 for each **Gong Carrier** in this unit, but for each unmodified rally roll of 1, you must remove a **Gong Carrier** from this unit after the command has been resolved.": "",
  "Apply the effect below that corresponds with the number of **daemonic power points** this unit has:\r\n**1** This unit has **^^Ward (6+)^^**.\r\n**2** This unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^**.\r\n**3** This unit has **^^Ward (4+)^^** against damage inflicted by **^^Spells^^**, **^^Prayers^^**, and abilites used by **^^Manifestations^^**. Otherwise, it has **^^Ward (5+)^^**.": "",
  "This unit's **Hobgrot Advisor** is a token. While this unit's **Hobgrot Advisor** is on the battlefield, add 3 to the control scores of friendly **^^Helsmiths of Hashut^^** units wholly within 12\" of this unit. If you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for this unit, remove this unit's **Hobgrod Advisor** from the battlefield, the attack fails, and the attack sequence ends.": "",
  "Roll a dice for each target. If the roll is lower than your **fury level**, for the rest of the turn:\r\n• The target cannot use the 'Eruption of Fury' ability.\r\n• When resolving the damage sequence for the target, your opponent cannot spend **rage dice** as part of the 'Fight Through the Pain' ability.\r\n• Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of weapons used for attacks that target that enemy unit.": "",
  "Roll a D3. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the enemy target equal to the roll.\r\nIf there is a friendly target, for the rest of the turn:\r\n• It can use a **^^Retreat^^** ability and still use **^^Shoot^^** and/or **^^Charge^^** abilities later in the turn.\r\n• Add 2\" to the distance it can move when using **^^Retreat^^** abilities.\r\n• No mortal damage is inflicted on it by **^^Retreat^^** abilities.": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Helsmiths of Hashut Infantry^^** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of its melee weapons for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Remove up to 3 models from this unit. Then, if the target is an **^^Infantry^^** unit, return a number of slain models to the target equal to the number of models you removed from this unit. If the target is a **^^War Machine^^**, heal a number of damage points allocated to the target equal to the number of models you removed from this unit.\r\nModels removed from this unit by this ability cannot be returned to\r\nthis unit.": "",
  "• Add 1 to casting rolls and unbinding rolls for this unit until the start of your next turn.\r\n• You can pick an objective or terrain feature that has a friendly **desolation token** and that this unit is contesting. If you do so, add 1 to this unit's power level for the rest of the battle, then remove that **desolation token** from the battlefield. This unit can be affected by this ability multiple times and the effects are cumulative.": "",
  "Apply the effect below that corresponds with the number of **daemonic power points** this unit has:\r\n**1** This unit has **^^Ward (6+)^^**.\r\n**2** Add 1 to casting rolls for this unit. In addition, this unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^**.\r\n**3** Add 2 to casting rolls for this unit. In addition, this unit has **^^Ward (4+)^^** against damage inflicted by **^^Spells^^**, **^^Prayers^^**, and abilites used by **^^Manifestations^^**. Otherwise, it has **^^Ward (5+)^^**.": "",
  "Add the **Horns and Hooves** weapon and 'Battle Damaged' and 'Daemonic Resilience' abilities to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 10\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 12.\r\n• Change the Control characteristic to 5.\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 3+.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the following keywords: **^^Monster^^**, **^^War Machine^^**, **^^Fly^^**.": "",
  "Add the **Crushing Horns and Hooves** weapon and 'Battle Damaged' and 'Daemonic Resilience' abilities to your hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 10\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 14.\r\n• Change the Control characteristic to 5.\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 3+.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the following keywords: **^^Monster^^**, **^^War Machine^^**, **^^Fly^^**.": "",
  "Roll a dice and apply the corresponding effect:\r\n**1-3 *Sacrificial Demand:*** Pick another friendly unit within 12\" of this unit. 1 model in that unit is slain. Otherwise, inflict D6 mortal damage on this unit.\r\n**4+ *Forbidden Knowledge:*** Pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn:\r\n• If this unit is a **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**, add 1 to its power level.\r\n• Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's melee weapons.\r\n• Add 3 to the control scores of friendly units while they are wholly within 12\" of this unit.": "",
  "While this unit has any **daemonic power points**, friendly non‑**^^Hobgrot Helsmiths of Hashut^^** units, excluding **War Despots**, with 0 **daemonic power points** count as having 1 **daemonic power point** while they are wholly within 9\" of and visible to this unit.\r\nAdd 3\" to the range of this ability while this unit has 2 **daemonic power points**. Add 6\" to the range of this ability instead while this unit has 3 **daemonic power points**.\r\n**Designer's Note:** *If a friendly unit with 0 daemonic power points is affected by this ability and subsequently gains 1 or more daemonic power points, this ability would stop affecting that unit. Also, Urak Taar's 'Master of Daemonic Power' ability has no effect on units affected by this ability*": ""
}
